      "images": [
        "videos/11-epigenetic-clock-reset/G6.jpg"
      ],
      "imageAt": [
        0,
        0.4
      ],
      "seconds": 23.58,
      "text": "Think of a hard drive. Aging was never the platter wearing out. It was the file system filling with clutter. Reformat the index, and the hardware is young again. But here is the honest part. They reset the clock, not the person. This happened in a dish, and a clock reading is not a cure. What they built is a window into aging, not a reversal of it.",
      "delivery": {
        "rate": 4,
        "pitch": -1
      },
